これ皮ある羊。え、わしもこの皮剥ぎたい。
These sheep have fleece. Hey, I want to shear this fleece too.

524
00:21:40,339 --> 00:21:41,239
えい。
Take that.

525
00:21:41,339 --> 00:21:44,239
あ、剥げないっぽい。叩くだけじゃ無理っぽいのじゃ。
Ah, doesn't seem to work. Looks like hitting alone won't do it.

526
00:21:45,839 --> 00:21:47,239
まつりあっち行った。
Matsuri went that way.

527
00:21:47,339 --> 00:21:50,839
ちょ、逆の…やっぱメンバーと逆の方に行きたいよね。
Wait, the opposite... As expected, I want to head the opposite way from the members.

528
00:21:51,339 --> 00:21:54,839
てかもう先輩、わしたちのことさ、探してるのかなー？
Wait, is Senpai already searching for us, I wonder?

529
