さっきさ、上でさ、集められたさ、羊のさ、毛？
The sheep's... wool that was collected up above earlier?

544
00:22:41,039 --> 00:22:45,839
羊の毛達がさ、今さ、ここのさ下のね、素材箱にね、
All that sheep's wool is now down here in these material chests...

545
00:22:46,539 --> 00:22:50,039
たくさん集まってるんじゃなかろうか。闇の結果…
Isn't a huge amount piling up here? The result of the darkness...

546
00:22:50,239 --> 00:22:52,039
え、何これ？入ってみたい！
Huh, what's this? I wanna go in!

547
00:22:52,239 --> 00:22:55,039
死ぬかな？え、これ死ぬ？
Will I die? Wait, will this kill me?

548
00:22:55,839 --> 00:22:57,239
これ死ぬ？
Will this kill me?

549
00:22:58,239 --> 00:22:59,039
えい。
Hup.

550
