何！？
What?!

555
00:23:11,039 --> 00:23:12,339
のじゃ。あっ！
Whoa! Ah!

556
00:23:12,839 --> 00:23:14,639
エレベーター的な感じ？
Is it like an elevator?

557
00:23:17,239 --> 00:23:19,539
もう一回…あ、これで戻れるの？
One more time... Ah, I can go back like this?

558
00:23:20,339 --> 00:23:22,539
え、すごーい！ね、すごいよお主等！
Whoa, amazing! Hey, that's awesome, guys!

559
00:23:22,939 --> 00:23:24,439
え、何お前！？
Wait, what are you?!

560
00:23:24,839 --> 00:23:26,539
ホラーゲームみたいなのいた。
There's a creature straight out of a horror game!

561
00:23:26,739 --> 00:23:28,539
ね、ホラーゲームみたいなのいるよ。
Hey, look, it's like something from a horror game!

562
