Ah, I thought that was Senpai, but...

617
00:25:51,727 --> 00:25:52,627
馬。
A horse.

618
00:25:52,627 --> 00:25:54,827
お前紛らわしいのじゃ。
You're confusing, noja.

619
00:25:54,827 --> 00:25:56,827
ねえ、お前紛ら... ねえ、わしもさ、乗せて？
Hey, you're so confu— Hey, give me a ride too?

620
00:25:56,827 --> 00:25:58,027
おい、あ、出られなくなった。
Hey, ah, I can't get out.

621
